# Naked cards

Card chrome lives in `src/components/ui/card.css` (`@apply` on `data-slot`). Use **naked** `Card`, `CardHeader`, `CardTitle`, `CardDescription`, `CardAction`, `CardContent`, and `CardFooter` — no Tailwind `className` utilities on them by default.

Equal padding on all sides comes from the primitive (`p-(--card-spacing)`). Do not re-add `p-*` / `px-*` / `py-*` / `gap-*` on Card sections at the call site.

Put content layout (stacks, grids, button rows) on **inner** elements, not on Card slots.

Allowed without asking:

- Props: `size="sm" | "default"`, `interactive`
- Runtime state only when a documented Card prop cannot express it — ask first

```tsx
// ✅
<Card>
  <CardHeader>
    <CardTitle>Access request</CardTitle>
  </CardHeader>
  <CardContent>
    <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-2">…</div>
  </CardContent>
</Card>

<Card interactive onClick={…}>…</Card>
<Card size="sm">…</Card>

// ❌
<Card className="gap-2 py-0">
  <CardHeader className="px-4 pt-4 pb-0">…</CardHeader>
  <CardContent className="space-y-3 px-4 pb-4">…</CardContent>
</Card>
```

See `design.md` → Components → Cards.
